OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested following security
OL,4,Aalert as residents return home
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have made two arrests following
OL,7,Fa security alert in east Belfast.
OL,9,FOfficers were called to Victor Place at
OL,10,Fabout 11:10 BST after a report of an
OL,11,Fearlier altercation and possible
OL,12,Fweapons at a property, which were later
OL,13,Fdiscovered to be imitations.
OL,15,FA 42-year-old man and a 38-year-old
OL,16,Fwoman were arrested at the scene.
OL,18,FA number of people were evacuated from
OL,19,Ftheir homes but returned just before
OL,20,F19:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
